{"id":"en_end-of-days-only-she-stayed","title":"End Of Days, Only She Stayed","titleEn":"End Of Days, Only She Stayed","description":"She rescued him at great personal cost, sacrificing her own appearance, and then raised his exceptionally gifted son far from home. A decade passes before he becomes fascinated by the boy's abilities, yet he inflicts suffering on the woman without realizing who she truly is. Once the deception collapses, their son comes into his power, mends her wounds, and brings back her former looks. Side by side, they bring down a despot. The lingering question is whether a love dormant for ten years can govern a transformed world. Dramzio is a place where this series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/end-of-days-only-she-stayed/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/end-of-days-only-she-stayed/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Karma Payback","Redemption","Wish-Fulfillment","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz386/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_end-of-days-only-she-stayed_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz386/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_end-of-days-only-she-stayed_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz386/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_end-of-days-only-she-stayed_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cz386/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_end-of-days-only-she-stayed_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"r